  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Denmark&#x2019;s Contribution to the Sexual Rights Initiative (SRI) in 2020-2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danish contribution is for a project focused on building capacity of SRGR advocates in developing countries, delivering seminars to enhance capacity and knowledge on SRHR challenges, and ensuring national implementation of human rights recommendations, as outlined in SRI&#x2019;s Funding Proposal to the Permanent Mission of Denmark in Geneva.</narrative>
